# Large model artifacts -- Decision 39 bakes the Clay v1.5 checkpoint into
# the Actor's Docker image (see Dockerfile), but the checkpoint ITSELF
# (~4.8GB, vendor/clay-v1.5.ckpt) is never committed to git -- copied there
# locally for `docker build` to pick up. See Decision 44's own note on the
# still-unresolved gap this creates for the real GHCR CI pipeline
# (.github/workflows/docker-build.yml only checks out this repo, so it has
# no way to obtain this file yet).
*.ckpt
*.pth
*.pt

# OpenWolf / Claude Code local tooling scaffold -- auto-provisioned by the
# environment, not part of this project; never intended to be committed.
.wolf/
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
